 "title": "Home",
 "text": "Home\nLisbon, Ohio\nWelcome to Columbiana County. Please, Return Often. (330) 424-7777\nHome\nColumbiana County is located on the eastern edge of Ohio and is bouded on the east by the State of Pennsylvania, on the south by the Ohio River and Jefferson and Carroll Counties, on the west by Carroll and Stark Counties, and on the north by Mahoning County. The county is irregular in shape, has a total area of 534 square miles, and is composed of 18 townships.\nHome\nE-911\nHistory\nCounty Flag\nAuditor's Office\nBoard of Elections\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioner's\nCoroner's Office\nEconomic Development\nEmergency Management\nHealth Department\nRecorder's Office\nTreasurer's Office\nSheriff's Office\nProsecutor's Office\nVeterans Service Center\nJuvenile Court\nLinks\nCopyright © Columbiana County Courts. All Rights Reserved.\n|\nMain Menu\nJoomla3 Appliance - Powered by TurnKey Linux",
